- op: discuss  # 1dc4
  at: '2026-10-20T02:34:46Z'  # 1dc4
  by: agent  # 1dc4
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1dc4
  clock: 3  # 1dc4
  nonce: 1dc4  # 1dc4
  message: "MEASURED: (1) with --cwd and NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=9000, scip-python indexes the whole hypergumbo tree: 1,712 project files, 306 s, 8.4 GB RSS, 131 MB index. (2) A THIRD defect found on a small non-git project: with no --project-version scip-python reads the git revision, and outside a git checkout it crashes on the first module (TypeError in ScipSymbol.normalizeNameOrVersion, exit 1). The recorded fixtures were produced with '--project-version 0.1.0' from inside the project, which is why they worked. (3) The full hypergumbo run with the fixed backend on the whole repo (Python ~3.9 GB + node ~8.4 GB) was stopped by Claude Code for low system memory on this 22 GB machine; not re-run. Fix scope on branch jgstern-agent/fix/nijod-scip-python-cwd: --cwd, constant --project-version 0, empty-index-on-a-Python-tree = unreported, OOM message names NODE_OPTIONS. The heap LIMIT is left to the user (it is memory on their machine)."  # 1dc4
