  message: "Fixed in PR #1746 (dev 1d26944212). invoke now runs 'scip-python index --cwd <project> --project-name N --project-version 0 --output <scratch>/index.scip'; an empty index of a tree with .py files reads silence_reason=unreported instead of the routine no_candidate_construct; a node heap exhaustion names NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size. BEHAVIORAL REPRO with the real scip-python 0.6.6 binary, HYPERGUMBO_SCIP_PYTHON=1, on a 3-function non-git project (Shape/Square.area/total): before (dev dbeef1ab2a) the scip_python pass emitted 0 nodes, silence_reason no_candidate_construct; after, on merged dev, 5 nodes / 5 edges, silence_reason None, and total -> Square.area carries origin [python, scip]. Whole-repo cost measured with the binary directly: 1,712 files, 306 s, 8.4 GB RSS with --max-old-space-size=9000 (default heap aborts at 4.2 GB). NOT MEASURED: a complete whole-repo hypergumbo run with the backend (stopped for low system memory on this 22 GB machine) -- that is WI-losig's to settle."  # 96f0
